            "C : une date précise est annoncée."
          ],
          "example": "Moved to Friday."
        },
        "en": {
          "rule": "In case of a change, the new information is correct.",
          "why_wrong": [
            "A: Thursday is mentioned.",
            "B: that is the old information.",
            "C: a specific date is given."
          ],
          "example": "Moved to Friday."
